| 4 | `string $opt = ''` | `VALUE_REQUIRED` | `<omitted>` <br> `--opt=val` | `''` (default) <br> `'val'`
| 5 | `?string $opt = ''` | `VALUE_OPTIONAL` | `<omitted>`<br>`--opt`<br>`--opt=val` | `''` (default)<br>`null`<br>`'val'` |
| 6 |  <del>`?string $opt = null`</del><br>(proposed for removal) | `VALUE_OPTIONAL` | `<omitted>`<br>`--opt`<br>`--opt=val` | `null` (default)<br>`null`<br>`'val'` |
