Consistent rules are:
 * all options must define a default value
 * the default value is used only when the option is omitted
 * boolean options are defined as `VALUE_NONE`
 * non-false boolean options are defined as `VALUE_NAGATABLE`
 * non-boolean/non-nullable options are defined as `VALUE_REQUIRED`
 * non-boolean/nullable options are defined as `VALUE_OPTIONAL`
